@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
title Role selection and Occupation baseline
rectangle "Target Roles" as A
rectangle "Confirm Role selection" as B
rectangle "Resolve Occupation and applicable skill set" as C
rectangle "Complete valid mastery coverage?" as D
rectangle "Baseline not required" as E
rectangle "Existing attempt or available baseline?" as F
rectangle "Resume pinned attempt" as G
rectangle "Start required Occupation baseline" as H
rectangle "No baseline configured" as I
rectangle "Finalize sufficient evidence\nand initialize profile" as J
rectangle "View result and My Mastery" as K
A --> B
B --> C
C --> D
D --> E : Yes
D --> F : No
F --> G : Existing attempt
F --> H : Available
F --> I : Absent
H --> J
G --> J
J --> K
note bottom of F
Dependency failure is unavailable/retry,
never absent configuration.
end note
@enduml
